     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under Output 1 of the project;

Indicator 1.1.1.1. Stakeholder Analysis Report Developed
1 Curricula Development Workshop has been organized on October 2020, with the participation of around 60 persons from UNDP, Ministry of National Education, vocational high schools, and NGOs.
5 Stakeholder Consultation Meetings have been carried out with 19 (plus 8 sectoral NGO/INGO) stakeholders Stakeholder Consultation Meetings conducted
